      "mentions": [
        "char_di_zang_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlimited Qi Sea can expend qi path immortal materials when used offensively and absorb external qi currents when used defensively. Fang Yuan uses the move to absorb the immortal material qi currents in Heavenly Court’s primordial qi wall. After absorbing two qi walls and exploring Qi Sea grotto-heaven, he holds a huge amount of immortal material qi currents, and the move’s stored power rises to a level that feels terrifying even to him.",
